# A parameter line names the parameter's identifier without its mode mark,
# `list` and never `@list`; the mark's removal is the certain fix (spec § 1;
# panel 253's R2, the coordinator's ruling).

# Adds `more` to `list`, in its place.
#
#~v doc_unknown_parameter
# - `@list`: the caller's list, which gains one value
# - `more`: the value it gains
function grow(@list: [i64], more: i64)
    list @ list.push(more)
